---

This project is an independent reimplementation for Minecraft 1.19.2, inspired
by the original Power Converters mod for 1.7.10 and earlier. It shares that
mod's concept and block layout but contains none of its source code. All
credit for the original idea belongs to its authors.

This repository does not contain, and does not redistribute, any part of
IndustrialCraft 2, BuildCraft, Jade, Minecraft Forge or Minecraft. It only
compiles against their public APIs.
